  characterName: Chinwe Okoro
  promptText: "Repeated oil spills have killed our mangroves and poisoned the river.
    The oil companies\u2019 money is what keeps our school running. If I report the
    spills and demand a cleanup, we lose it. Do I expose the pollution, or keep the
    children in school?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, expose the spills; a clean river secures the longer future.
  rightAnswer: No, keep the funding; the school sustains children today.
